Tell us in the comments which item you

178
00:09:03,993 --> 00:09:07,023
rescued, and what you would like us to
explain next.

179
00:09:08,173 --> 00:09:09,205
See you tomorrow.

180
00:09:09,659 --> 00:09:12,041
Share this with someone whose white shirt
has

181
00:09:12,051 --> 00:09:13,489
